      "<strong>Web development.</strong> Company websites, landing pages and content sites built on modern frameworks such as Astro, Next.js and React, or on WordPress when your team wants to edit pages without a developer. For most service businesses in Singapore, from renovation contractors to accounting firms, we recommend a static site: it loads quickly on mobile, costs little to host and has very little to hack. The static plan covers up to 100 pages, responsive layouts, enquiry forms routed to email and WhatsApp, and deployment. Details are on the <a href=\"/services/web-development/\">web development service page</a>.",
