      "<strong>SEO.</strong> Search engine optimisation for google.com.sg: technical health, on-page work, content and local search. For B2B firms we build service and industry pages that answer procurement questions; for consumer businesses we focus on neighbourhood and category searches. The SEO section below covers multilingual search in English, Chinese and Malay. Our general approach is on the <a href=\"/services/seo-services/\">SEO services page</a>.",
      "<strong>Custom software and web apps.</strong> Client portals, booking and scheduling systems, quotation tools, inventory dashboards and admin panels. Typical Singapore examples: a tuition centre that needs class scheduling and parent notifications, a logistics firm that wants customers to track consignments, or a clinic group that needs an internal dashboard pulling data from several systems. Many requests for a mobile app are better served by a progressive web app that installs from the browser and updates without app store review.",
      "<strong>AI automation.</strong> Automations that remove repetitive admin: enquiries from your website, Facebook and Instagram forms flowing into a CRM, WhatsApp confirmations for bookings, invoice data moving into Xero or QuickBooks, and AI assistants that answer routine customer questions from your own documents. We map the current process before automating it, because automating a confused process just makes the confusion faster.",
      "<strong>Maintenance.</strong> After hosting goes live you get five months of maintenance included: content and price updates, bug fixes, security and dependency updates, backups, and uptime and speed checks. After that, maintenance continues from " + usd("Maintenance") + ", or you contact us only when something needs changing.",
