      "<strong>Marketplaces alongside your own store.</strong> Many Singapore brands sell on Shopee, Lazada or Amazon.sg as well as their own site. Marketplaces bring volume but also fees, price comparison and little customer data. Your own store is where repeat customers, email subscribers and higher margins live. We can connect product catalogues so stock levels stay consistent across channels, and we design the own-store experience to give buyers a reason to come back, such as bundles, member pricing or content the marketplaces do not allow.",
