      "<strong>Content and trust.</strong> For regulated or high-trust services such as clinics, financial advisers, lawyers and education providers, content needs to be accurate and restrained. We write or edit pages that explain services plainly, cite your qualifications and registrations where relevant, avoid promises about results, and keep advertising-sensitive claims out of the copy. You approve every page before it goes live.",
