      { name: "CBD, Raffles Place, Marina Bay and Tanjong Pagar", text: "The Central Business District holds banks, insurers, law firms, consultancies, family offices, regional headquarters and a thick layer of professional services around them. Websites here are judged by procurement teams and senior partners who expect restraint, precise language and fast pages. Typical needs are practice or service pages that answer due-diligence questions, partner and team profiles, secure client portals or document exchange, and careful handling of regulated claims. For firms with regional coverage we often add country pages for Malaysia, Indonesia or Hong Kong, each with its own useful content." },
      { name: "one-north and Buona Vista", text: "Fusionopolis, Biopolis and Mediapolis cluster technology companies, research institutes, biomedical firms, media businesses and many startups. These clients usually know exactly what they want technically and value developers who can talk about APIs, authentication and deployment pipelines. Common projects are marketing sites that the growth team can update weekly through a headless CMS, documentation portals, investor pages, dashboards for pilots with enterprise customers and first versions of a product that need to be built quickly without cutting corners on security." },
      { name: "Jurong and the west", text: "Jurong's industrial estates, Jurong Island's energy and chemicals cluster, Tuas and the Jurong Lake District bring together manufacturers, engineering firms, marine and offshore suppliers, logistics operators and the growing commercial hub around Jurong East. Their buyers are engineers and purchasing managers who want specifications, certifications, capacity and a named contact. Useful builds include searchable product and parts catalogues, request-for-quotation forms that accept drawings, pages for certifications and industries served, and simple portals for repeat B2B orders." },
      { name: "Changi and the airport cluster", text: "Changi Airport, Changi Business Park, the airfreight centre and the surrounding logistics parks host aviation services, freight forwarders, courier firms, data centres and regional operations teams. Their customers need to know lanes, service levels, cut-off times and how to get a quote without waiting a day. We build quote request flows that capture the details forwarders actually need, shipment tracking pages connected to existing systems, and multi-country service pages for firms that serve the wider region." },
      { name: "Tampines and the east", text: "Tampines is one of Singapore's regional centres, with large residential estates, malls, Tampines Regional Centre offices and plenty of neighbourhood businesses: tuition and enrichment centres, clinics, dental practices, beauty salons, gyms and home service companies. Buyers here search on phones, often with an area in the query, and decide fast. Websites need clear prices or price ranges, real photos, class or appointment booking, WhatsApp contact and area pages only where the business genuinely serves that neighbourhood." },
      { name: "Woodlands and the north", text: "Woodlands, with its regional centre, the Woodlands North Coast development and the Causeway to Johor Bahru, mixes residential estates, industrial parks and firms that operate on both sides of the border. Businesses here include manufacturers, logistics and warehousing firms, home service companies and retailers serving the northern estates. Cross-border businesses often need English and Malay content, pricing that is clear about which side of the Causeway a service applies to, and forms that route enquiries to the right team." },
      { name: "Paya Lebar, Punggol and other growth areas", text: "Paya Lebar has grown into a commercial hub east of the city, and the Punggol Digital District is being developed around technology and education. Across the island, heartland towns such as Ang Mo Kio, Bishan, Toa Payoh, Bedok and Yishun support thousands of small businesses. The same principle applies everywhere: build for the specific buyer, show real information, and make contact effortless on a phone." },
