      "Across these areas, Singapore's small and medium enterprises share a handful of sectors that we see most often in enquiries: food and beverage, retail and ecommerce, professional services such as accounting, legal and corporate secretarial firms, education and enrichment, clinics and wellness, renovation and interior design, logistics, and B2B trading. The region table further down summarises what each part of the island typically needs.",
