      "Singapore Standard Time is UTC+8 and India Standard Time is UTC+5:30. Neither country uses daylight saving, so the gap is a steady two and a half hours all year. That makes Singapore one of the easiest places for us to work with: our working day of 9 am to 9 pm IST runs from 11:30 am to 11:30 pm in Singapore, seven days a week on WhatsApp.",
