      "Speed matters because Singapore users are impatient and their alternatives are one tap away. Google's Core Web Vitals targets are a Largest Contentful Paint within 2.5 seconds, Interaction to Next Paint within 200 milliseconds and Cumulative Layout Shift below 0.1. We meet them with static HTML where possible, correctly sized modern image formats, subset fonts, especially for Chinese character sets which can be very large, lazy-loaded media and very few third-party scripts. We test on mid-range phones with throttled connections, not only on office fibre.",
